              <h4 class="font-serif text-base text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">Invisible Aligners at House of Dental</h4>
            </div>
            <ul class="space-y-2 list-disc list-inside leading-relaxed">
              <li><strong>Near-Invisible Appearance:</strong> Fabricated from crystal-clear, medical-grade BPA-free polymer that is virtually unnoticeable from a conversational distance.</li>
