          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-japandi-cream/80 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-1.5">
            <span class="font-semibold text-japandi-moss uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider block">Overbite (Deep Bite)</span>
            <p>Upper front teeth excessively overlap lower teeth, causing wear on lower incisors and potential jaw joint strain.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-japandi-cream/80 border border-japandi-clay/40 space-y-1.5">
            <span class="font-semibold text-japandi-moss uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider block">Crossbite &amp; Open Bite</span>
