            <span class="font-semibold text-japandi-moss uppercase text-[10px] tracking-wider block">Always Use Your Protective Case</span>
            <p>Whenever you remove your aligners for meals, store them in your ventilated travel case. Never wrap them in napkins, which are easily thrown away accidentally.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Pricing and Flexible 0% EMI Options -->
      <div class="space-y-4">
        <h3 class="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-serif text-japandi-charcoal font-medium">
          Invisible Aligners Cost in Bangalore &amp; Flexible Financing
